        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-14T03:49:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My Table top players we use Index cards to represent the various players. I have each player create a new Index card for tracking there turn, or keep the ones from previous games. Gives it a bit more personal touch.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, for minions and villians, for ease on me, I just do all them when they choose the enviroments. Makes turns go a bit faster for our groups, and easier to track when dealing with, oh let's says, 22 robot minions in issue 1 :D</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
