        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/aramis/{size}/1871_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-20T06:56:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had some foam sheet leftover from a project, and made two-sided counters for the purpose of \"who's gone\"...&nbsp; I am using them currently for Star Trek, but they will be used next time I run SCRPG... I used roughly 1.5mm thick foam sheet, spray glue, and then after bond, cut to 15x15mm squares... I use a large one to indicate which color is \"I've gone this turn\"...</p>",
